### ti-document-agent — direct call, port 8087
# NOT reachable through the gateway: these endpoints live under /rest/v1/**, and the
# gateway only proxies /api/v1/**. Call the service directly when testing standalone.

### Ask the RAG agent a question about uploaded documents
POST http://localhost:8087/rest/v1/docs?conversationId=b3f1c9a2-7e4d-4a1b-9c3e-1a2b3c4d5e6f
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "questionId": 42,
  "question": "What are the key risk factors mentioned in the uploaded document?"
}

###

### List uploaded documents
GET http://localhost:8087/rest/v1/documents
Accept: application/json

###

### Generate questions from a document
POST http://localhost:8087/rest/v1/documents/101/question-generation
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userMessage": "Generate questions about the compliance obligations described in this document.",
  "requestedQuestionCount": 3
}

###

### Version check
GET http://localhost:8087/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###
